It builds on the following work.

Muse Gadget SDK
  https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk
  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. Apache License 2.0.
  The client in link/ follows the protocol of the SDK's Linux client, and the
  tests run against a fake Muse built on the SDK's Python code.

  The SDK's Jollybot avatar is not under that licence and is not included
  here. tools/avatar.sh builds it on your own machine from your own clone of
  the SDK.

rust-psp
  vendor/psp
  https://github.com/overdrivenpotato/rust-psp
  MIT License. This is version 0.3.14 of the psp crate with one addition in
  src/sys/net.rs, the sceNetInetPoll call and its SceNetInetPollfd type,
  which the upstream crate does not declare. The font in src/status.rs is
  that crate's msxfont.bin.

Root certificates
  link/certs
  DigiCert Global Root G2 and GTS Root R4, the public certificates of two
  certificate authorities, as shipped in operating system trust stores.

The Rust crates the app links against are fetched by Cargo and are not
included here. They are rustls, rustls-rustcrypto and the RustCrypto crates
beneath it, serde and serde_json, getrandom, spin and zeroize, each under its
own licence.
